 "press_quotes": [
  {
   "quote": "Inside, the spaciousness is surprising: the forward cabins are roomy and comfortable, offering sleeping accommodations worthy of much larger sailboats.'",
   "source": "Voiles et Voiliers"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The transition between inside and outside is natural and imperceptible, so much so that the entire deck becomes a single space.",
   "source": "Nautica y Yates"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The Lagoon 38 appeals with its balance: an accessible, comfortable, and well-designed catamaran for family cruising as well as for your first big voyages.",
   "source": "Multicoques MAG"
  },
  {
   "quote": "As for comfort on board, it is exceptional for the size of the boat, and the layout of the starboard hull is a real success.",
   "source": "Multihulls world"
  },
  {
   "quote": "An answer to a gap in the market, the Lagoon 38 brings bigger things to smaller packages, offering a lot of boat for its price tag. A redesigned hull shape brings a new level of extra volume inside, providing room for plenty of various comforts. Overall, it features flexible uses of space indoors and out.",
   "source": "Newport Boat Show"
  },
  {
   "quote": "As part of Lagoon’s increased emphasis on circulation and ease of movement, boarding has been made easy due to extended outer transoms, which can also be used for easy access to the water as well as jumping and diving platforms.",
   "source": "YachtStyle"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The new Lagoon 38 is the entry point into the world of Lagoon catamarans but, despite being only 11 metres long, it rivals larger models in the range, particularly the 40, in terms of interior space and volume.",
   "source": "GIORNALE DELLA VELA"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The Lagoon 38 Catamaran is a remarkable addition to the Lagoon family, bringing a blend of luxury, comfort, and performance for both novice and experienced sailors alike. This versatile catamaran is designed to meet the needs of those seeking to enjoy day sails, weekend getaways, or even longer cruising adventures in style. With its exceptional build quality, elegant design, and cutting-edge technology, the Lagoon 38 promises a sailing experience like no other.",
   "source": "OUR YACHT WORLD"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The all-new Lagoon 38 builds on the legacy of the beloved Lagoon 380—offering more space, smarter design, and enhanced comfort. Inspired by larger luxury catamarans, it invites you to dream big.",
   "source": "YACHT CROATIA"
  }
 ]
